@HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Create User (POST)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "countryIsoCode": "RU",
  "locale": "ru-RU"
}

### 2. Get User by ID (GET)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Accept: application/json

### 3. Update User (PUT)
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "countryIsoCode": "US",
  "locale": "en-US"
}

### 4. Get All Users (GET with Pagination)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/users?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json
